{"changes":["eka-core/conformance/cko.go: add ValidateCKOOptions.Draft callback (draft-target knowledge for the CKO path) and wire it into the engine","eka-core/conformance/validate.go: add engine.draftRef field","eka-core/conformance/rules.go: rule 5 consults the draft-target hook after resolution fails in both CKO branches; versioned references excluded; repo path untouched (hook never set)","eka-core/runtime/draft.go: add draftExists/draftExistsIn/draftTargetOf helpers (same drafts-tree existence test as the note subject tolerance) and wire the hook in ValidateDraft, Publish and PublishInline","eka-core/conformance/cko_test.go: TestValidateCKOUnresolvedRelationshipDraftTargetTolerance, TestValidateCKOUnresolvedRelationshipDraftTargetAbsent, TestValidateCKOUnresolvedRelationshipDraftTargetVersioned","eka-core/runtime/draft_test.go: TestValidateDraftDraftToDraftTargetTolerance (draft-to-draft validates clean, missing target still flags R5, publish gate shares the tolerance)"],"role":"implementation","summary":"Fixed R5 rejecting draft-to-draft references in eka draft validate: a draft referencing another draft (both unpublished) failed rule 5 because the target exists only in the drafts tree, never in the canonical store. Added an explicit draft-target hook (ValidateCKOOptions.Draft) that rule 5 consults after resolution fails: a line-level reference whose target exists as a draft of the same project is an allowed authoring reference and produces no finding. The runtime wires the hook in ValidateDraft, Publish and PublishInline using the same drafts-tree existence test the note subject tolerance uses (workspace/drafts/\u003cproject\u003e/\u003ctype\u003e-\u003cid\u003e.json|.md). Versioned references are never tolerated (drafts carry no instance versions), and the repository Validate path never sets the hook, so published objects referencing missing or draft-only targets still flag R5.","tests":["TestValidateCKOUnresolvedRelationshipDraftTargetTolerance","TestValidateCKOUnresolvedRelationshipDraftTargetAbsent","TestValidateCKOUnresolvedRelationshipDraftTargetVersioned","TestValidateDraftDraftToDraftTargetTolerance"]}